{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":86703,\"title\":\"The Bright Star of Heavens\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The plot of “Dao Jarut Fah” centers around two feuding likay (folk opera) bands: Sao Noi Phet Baan Paeng and the Nu Paan Wiset Sin. Dao and Fah are two sisters from the “Sao Noi Phet Baan Paeng” likay band, their father Ken is the owner. One day, Ken collapses on stage and falls ill. He was overwhelmed by the fact that his shows were being sabotaged by Busaba, owner of the “Nu Paan Wiset Sin” band. Busaba hired men to cause havoc and lure audiences away from the “Sao Noi Phet Baan Paeng” shows. After shortly falling ill, Ken dies. Dao blames Busaba and her band for her father’s death and decides to go undercover to get revenge. She auditioned to be the new singer for the “Nu Paan Wiset Sin” band.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ogUe7jjkEHyAOgYHsclSYGImNLw.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3QuVe75sIJgCOjsPytEwWCaPgip.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":1,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"ONE 31\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TH\",\"name\":\"TH\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2019-03-07\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1105573,\"name\":\"Nuengthida Sophon\",\"character\":\"Dao\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l1ZkKeF0vUDsDECuWjUGIrVfoTU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1344503,\"name\":\"Yuttana Puangklang\",\"character\":\"Pon\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNUwrRoIlOqFfjP8nlITIYAn3cP.jpg\"},{\"id\":3868842,\"name\":\"Tai Orathai\",\"character\":\"Fah\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ouTdY8W8GcQ2WMBKKIUz4wHI0kw.jpg\"},{\"id\":5906128,\"name\":\"Arnuttaphol Sirichumsaeng\",\"character\":\"Non\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gn3Fhv9yZEBy9AcPz6QWMDvWAFO.jpg\"},{\"id\":3297866,\"name\":\"Arisara Thongborisut\",\"character\":\"Pat